## 8. Success Metrics

### Primary Metric
* **Median Time-to-Resolution for AI-assisted tickets** — The goal is to reduce the time support agents spend manually searching across orders, tickets, agreements, policies, and product documentation.

### Secondary Metric
* **AI-assisted resolution rate** — Percentage of tickets where AI provides sufficient evidence for the support agent to resolve the issue without additional manual investigation.
